menu "Projecta PM335 (Bluetooth, optional)"

    config PM335_ENABLE
        bool "Connect to a Projecta Intelli-RV PM335 over Bluetooth"
        default n
        help
            Adds water tanks and Hot water / Water pump switches to the Overview and a
            PM335 card to the web page. Off: the Overview shows large temperature tiles
            (the original layout) and Bluetooth is never started.

    config PM335_MAC
        string "PM335 BLE address"
        default "00:00:00:00:00:00"
        help
            The unit's Bluetooth address (the IntelliJay app lists it; or scan with
            nRF Connect). The login password (the app's pairing key) is not set here:
            it's stored on the display through the web API.

    config PM335_POLL_S
        int "System status poll interval (s)"
        default 3
        range 2 300

endmenu
